  "bodyHash": "sdPIYRox7u8=",
  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyshulkerboxes/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyshulkerboxes/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flunapixel.studio%252fdiscord\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Discord&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252fFusseel\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Twitter&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=x&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"116\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@heyitsfuzs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=YouTube&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=GitHub&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=CurseForge&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fFuzs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Modrinth&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyshulkerboxes/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">简易潜影盒</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 让您可以直接在背包中完全操控潜影盒——无需将其放置在地面上，即可放入物品、取出物品、浏览内容和管理存储空间。📦</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">该模组灵感来源于Minecraft现代束口袋的交互机制，让便携存储变得自然直观。您可以通过滚动🖱️浏览存储物品，精准选择所需物品🎯，单击即可快速转移物品，跨多个格子拖拽批量操作，或使用单物品模式进行精细管理。✨</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">除了原版潜影盒外，该模组还支持末影箱，并可通过数据包扩展兼容其他模组中的存储物品。🔗</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">与仅显示工具提示的模组不同，本模组并非仅客户端模组。它增加了真实的背包交互功能，必须在客户端和服务器上同时安装。如果您只想在工具提示中预览潜影盒内容，请查看这款仅客户端替代方案：</span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/shulkerboxtooltip\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">潜影盒工具提示（Shulker Box Tooltip）</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">，由</span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/misterpemodder\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MisterPeModder</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">制作。💡</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">您也在使用束口袋吗？请查看</span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bundle-upgrade\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">束口袋升级（Bundle Upgrade）</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">，它也为Minecraft的束口袋带来了同样便捷的优化！🎒</span></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyshulkerboxes/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/features.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">📦 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">背包内存储访问：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">无需将存储物品放置在世界中，即可直接从中放入或取出物品。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🔍 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">详细内容预览：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">在物品工具提示中直接查看存储内容，轻松了解每个存储物品里有什么。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🎯 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">选择任意存储物品：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">使用滚轮或键盘方向键精确选择想要交互的存储物品，而非仅限于最近放入的那一个。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">📝 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">选定物品详情：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">浏览存储内容时即时查看当前选中物品的附加信息。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">↔️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">快速物品转移：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">将物品点击到存储物品上，或将存储物品点击到背包格子中，即可快速转移内容。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🖱️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">跨多个格子拖拽：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">点击并拖拽经过多个背包格子，即可批量放入或取出物品，大幅提升管理效率。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🎚️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">精确物品移动：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">按住</span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Ctrl</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">（Mac为</span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Command</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">）移动单个物品而非整组，精确控制转移数量。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">📊 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">存储填充指示器：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">可选择在支持的存储物品上显示束口袋风格的填充条，一目了然查看剩余容量。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">💡 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">智能兼容性提示：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">直观显示手持物品是否能被放入，以及存储中是否已存在相同物品。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⚙️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">高度可配置：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">自定义交互方式、控制按键、工具提示行为和视觉效果，匹配您喜爱的游戏风格。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🔗 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">数据包驱动兼容性：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">通过数据包可添加对其他存储物品的支持，兼容众多模组中的背包和存储方案。</span></li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyshulkerboxes/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/media.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyshulkerboxes/media/1.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyshulkerboxes/media/2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyshulkerboxes/media/3.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyshulkerboxes/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/installation.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">必须在客户端与服务端均安装本模组</span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需要安装</span></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/puzzles-lib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Puzzles Lib</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">（Fabric与NeoForge平台）</span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需要安装</span></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Fabric API</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">（Fabric平台）</span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需要安装</span></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forge-config-api-port-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Forge Config API Port</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">（Fabric平台）</span></strong></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyshulkerboxes/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/configuration.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">如果模组支持配置，您可以通过游戏内的模组菜单直接进行配置（需要安装</span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmodmenu\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Mod Menu</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">模组，由</span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fProspector\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Prospector</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">制作，仅限Fabric平台）。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">如需使用外部文本编辑器手动配置，所有文件位于</span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">.minecraft/config</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">文件夹中，文件名按照配置类型命名为</span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MOD_ID-client.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">、</span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MOD_ID-common.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">或</span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MOD_ID-server.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">。并非所有模组都包含全部配置类型，甚至可能没有任何配置文件。</span></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyshulkerboxes/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/credits.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">感谢</span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/kir_antipov\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Kir_Antipov</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">，其模组</span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/packed-inventory\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Packed Inventory</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">启发了本模组的末影箱功能。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">特别感谢</span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/mrniddala\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MrNiddala</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">，他的创意启发了本模组中通过在背包不同格子间拖拽存储物品，从而批量放入或取出物品的特性。</span></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyshulkerboxes/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><table style=\"text-align:center\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nether-chested\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/netherchested/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/horse-expert\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/horseexpert/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tiny-skeletons\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/tinyskeletons/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mindful-darkness\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mindfuldarkness/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/armored-foes\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/armoredfoes/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pixelshot\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/pixelshot/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/new-shroomcraft\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/shroomcraft/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/let-me-sleep\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/letmesleep/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pick-up-notifier\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/pickupnotifier/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/effect-insights\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/effectinsights/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyshulkerboxes/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flunapixel.studio%252fdiscord\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/studio.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyshulkerboxes/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>",
